      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe it\u0027s a permission.  So, typically, users would not have permissions to create namespaces, but would have perms to create project requests (which cause projects to be created; that\u0027s what we do here).  But there\u0027s a permission that would allow direct namespace creation (that\u0027s how the component that processes the project requests works).",
